<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Confirm Hospital Visit - RedConnect</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🩸</text></svg>">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/register.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <div class="quote-section">
    <h2>"Confirm Your Hospital Visit"</h2>
    <p>A doctor will examine you at the hospital. Admin will verify you after screening before final donation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <div class="faq-section">
      <h3>What happens next?</h3>
      <div class="faq-item active">
        <div class="faq-question"><h4>Step 1 — You confirm visit</h4></div>
        <div class="faq-answer" style="max-height:120px;padding-bottom:12px;">
          <p>You receive an email with the hospital and time to come for screening.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item active">
        <div class="faq-question"><h4>Step 2 — Doctor examines you</h4></div>
        <div class="faq-answer" style="max-height:120px;padding-bottom:12px;">
          <p>At the hospital, medical staff check if you are fit to donate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item active">
        <div class="faq-question"><h4>Step 3 — Admin verifies</h4></div>
        <div class="faq-answer" style="max-height:120px;padding-bottom:12px;">
          <p>After screening, admin confirms on the dashboard and emails you and the patient contact to proceed with blood donation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="register-container">
      <div class="register-header">
        <h1>🩺 Confirm hospital visit</h1>
      </div>

      <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
        <div style="background:#ffebee;border:2px solid #e74c3c;color:#c0392b;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <%= error %>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
      <% } else if (typeof screeningScheduled !== 'undefined' && screeningScheduled) { %>
        <div style="background:#e3f2fd;border:2px solid #2980b9;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;">
          <strong>✅ Visit scheduled</strong><br>
          Check your email for screening details.<br>
          <strong>When:</strong> <%= new Date(visitTime).toLocaleString() %><br>
          <strong>Where:</strong> <%= request.hospitalName %>, <%= request.city %><br><br>
          After the doctor examines you, admin will verify you and send a final email if you are cleared to donate.
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else if (typeof adminVerified !== 'undefined' && adminVerified) { %>
        <div style="background:#e8f5e9;border:2px solid #27ae60;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          ✅ Admin has verified you as healthy. Check your email for final donation instructions.
          <% if (visitTime) { %><br><strong>Time:</strong> <%= new Date(visitTime).toLocaleString() %><% } %>
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else if (typeof awaitingDoctor !== 'undefined' && awaitingDoctor) { %>
        <div style="background:#fff3e0;border:2px solid #e67e22;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          ⏳ You are scheduled for doctor screening. Please visit the hospital at the time in your email. Admin will verify you after examination.
          <% if (visitTime) { %><br><strong>When:</strong> <%= new Date(visitTime).toLocaleString() %><% } %>
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else if (typeof alreadyAssigned !== 'undefined' && alreadyAssigned) { %>
        <div style="background:#fff3e0;border:2px solid #e67e22;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          Another donor is already assigned for this request. Thank you for your willingness to help.
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else if (typeof declined !== 'undefined' && declined) { %>
        <div style="background:#f5f5f5;border:2px solid #999;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          Thank you. We have noted that you cannot donate for this request.
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else if (typeof rescheduled !== 'undefined' && rescheduled) { %>
        <div style="background:#e3f2fd;border:2px solid #2196F3;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
          <strong>✅ Request Noted</strong><br><br>
          <% if (rescheduleMessage) { %>
            <%= rescheduleMessage %><br><br>
          <% } %>
          We will contact you if an alternative time works for this request, or we will find another donor.
        </div>
        <a href="/donor/dashboard" class="back-link">← Donor Dashboard</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <p style="color:#666;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;">
          Patient <strong><%= request.patientName %></strong> needs <strong><%= request.bloodGroupRequired %></strong> at
          <strong><%= request.hospitalName %></strong>, <%= request.city %>.
        </p>

        <form method="POST" action="/request/<%= request._id %>/health/<%= donor._id %>" class="register-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="token" value="<%= token %>">

          <p style="font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:16px;">Can you come to the hospital for doctor screening?</p>

          <div class="form-group checkbox-group" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <input type="radio" name="healthy" id="healthy-yes" value="yes" required onchange="updateFormState()">
            <label for="healthy-yes">✅ Yes — I will come for screening at the scheduled time</label>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group checkbox-group" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
            <input type="radio" name="healthy" id="healthy-reschedule" value="reschedule" required onchange="updateFormState()">
            <label for="healthy-reschedule">🕐 I'm not available at this time — Show me alternative times</label>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group checkbox-group" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
            <input type="radio" name="healthy" id="healthy-no" value="no" required onchange="updateFormState()">
            <label for="healthy-no">❌ No — I cannot donate for this request</label>
          </div>

          <!-- Alternative times section (hidden by default) -->
          <div id="altTimesSection" style="display:none;background:#f5f5f5;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;">
            <p style="font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12px;">Choose an alternative time:</p>
            <div id="altTimesContainer" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;"></div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Confirm</button>
        </form>

        <script>
          function updateFormState() {
            const rescheduleRadio = document.getElementById('healthy-reschedule');
            const altTimesSection = document.getElementById('altTimesSection');
            
            if (rescheduleRadio.checked) {
              altTimesSection.style.display = 'block';
              loadAlternativeTimes();
            } else {
              altTimesSection.style.display = 'none';
            }
          }

          function loadAlternativeTimes() {
            const container = document.getElementById('altTimesContainer');
            const times = [
              { label: 'Tomorrow at 9:00 AM', value: 'tomorrow-9am' },
              { label: 'Tomorrow at 2:00 PM', value: 'tomorrow-2pm' },
              { label: 'Day after at 10:00 AM', value: 'dayafter-10am' },
              { label: 'Day after at 3:00 PM', value: 'dayafter-3pm' },
              { label: 'In 4 days at 10:00 AM', value: '4days-10am' }
            ];

            container.innerHTML = '';
            times.forEach(time => {
              const label = document.createElement('label');
              label.style.display = 'flex';
              label.style.alignItems = 'center';
              label.style.padding = '8px';
              label.style.cursor = 'pointer';
              label.style.borderRadius = '4px';
              label.style.transition = 'background 0.2s';
              label.onmouseover = () => label.style.background = '#eee';
              label.onmouseout = () => label.style.background = 'transparent';
              
              const input = document.createElement('input');
              input.type = 'radio';
              input.name = 'alternativeTime';
              input.value = time.value;
              input.style.marginRight = '8px';
              
              label.appendChild(input);
              label.appendChild(document.createTextNode(time.label));
              container.appendChild(label);
            });
          }
        </script>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
